                                                                                
******************************************************************              
*                                                                               
* PROGRAM     : W5518200.                                                       
*                                                                               
* FUNKTION    : INLEVHIS - SKAPAR EN INLEVERANS HISTORIK                        
*               (K÷RS BL.A F÷R STEN-≈KE THUNBERG)                               
*               NY INLEVHIS SOM TAR LEVERANT÷RSREGISTRET OCH                    
*               KOMPLETTERAR MED LEVERANT÷RENS LAND.                            
*                                                                               
*  INFILER    : W611.W611V1.W6118K (COPY OF W020.V≈≈VV.MRHIST)                  
*               WXTR.PARTINFO.WCDCDAY                                           
*               WXTR.W213D1.W21320                                              
*                                                                               
*  UTFILER    : W551.W551B8.W55182                                              
*                                                                               
* F÷RFATTARE  : ARUP DATTA                                                      
*                                                                               
******************************************************************              
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    FILE SECTION                                *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
FILE W55182D1                                                                   
%W6117901 'IN1-'                                                                
*                                                                               
FILE W55182D2                                                                   
%WCDCPART 'IN2-'                                                                
*                                                                               
FILE W55182D3                                                                   
%W21320   'IN3-'                                                                
*                                                                               
FILE TFIL00      FB(29 0)                                                       
T00-IDARTNR    1   5  P                                                         
T00-IDFKNGRP   6   3  P                                                         
T00-IDANSK     9   2  P                                                         
T00-KDPRODSL  11   2  P                                                         
T00-IDLEVNR   13   5  A                                                         
T00-PRARTSTD  18   5  P  2                                                      
T00-PRARTBES  23   5  P  2                                                      
T00-IDLANDX2  28   2  A                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE TFIL01      FB(29  0)                                                      
T01-IDARTNR    1   5  P                                                         
T01-IDFKNGRP   6   3  P                                                         
T01-IDANSK     9   2  P                                                         
T01-KDPRODSL  11   2  P                                                         
T01-IDLEVNR   13   5  A                                                         
T01-PRARTSTD  18   5  P  2                                                      
T01-PRARTBES  23   5  P  2                                                      
T01-IDLANDX2  28   2  A                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE TFIL02      FB(29  0)                                                      
T02-IDARTNR    1   5  P                                                         
T02-IDFKNGRP   6   3  P                                                         
T02-IDANSK     9   2  P                                                         
T02-KDPRODSL  11   2  P                                                         
T02-IDLEVNR   13   5  A                                                         
T02-PRARTSTD  18   5  P  2                                                      
T02-PRARTBES  23   5  P  2                                                      
T02-IDLANDX2  28   2  A                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE TFIL03      FB(29  0)                                                      
T03-IDARTNR    1   5  P                                                         
T03-IDFKNGRP   6   3  P                                                         
T03-IDANSK     9   2  P                                                         
T03-KDPRODSL  11   2  P                                                         
T03-IDLEVNR   13   5  A                                                         
T03-PRARTSTD  18   5  P  2                                                      
T03-PRARTBES  23   5  P  2                                                      
T03-IDLANDX2  28   2  A                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE TMRHIST     FB(106 0)                                                      
%W6117901 'MR-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
FILE W55182D4 PRINTER VB(56 0)                                                  
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
PRODSL         W  7  A                                                          
W-LAND         W 15  A                                                          
STDPR          W 11  N  2   MASK 'ZZZZZZZZ9.99'                                 
W-FILL-01      W  1  A      VALUE ';'                                           
FIRST-LINE     S  1  A      VALUE 'J'                                           
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB         *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
SORT W55182D1 TO TMRHIST USING (IN1-IDARTNR) BEFORE URVAL                       
*                                                                               
  URVAL.   PROC                                                                 
    IF IN1-IDPTYP = 'R32'                                                       
       IF IN1-KDAVVANT < 2                                                      
          IF IN1-KDRT = 00                                                      
                SELECT                                                          
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-PROC                                                                      
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W55182D2                                                              
*                                                                               
    T00-IDARTNR    = IN2-IDARTNR                                                
    T00-IDFKNGRP   = IN2-IDFKNGRP                                               
    T00-IDANSK     = IN2-IDANSK                                                 
    T00-KDPRODSL   = IN2-KDPRODSL                                               
    T00-IDLEVNR    = IN2-IDLEVNR                                                
    T00-PRARTSTD   = IN2-PRARTSTD                                               
    T00-PRARTBES   = IN2-PRARTBES                                               
    T00-IDLANDX2   = ' '                                                        
    PUT TFIL00                                                                  
*                                                                               
SORT TFIL00 TO TFIL01 USING T00-IDLEVNR                                         
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W55182D3 KEY IN3-IDLEVNR TFIL01 KEY T01-IDLEVNR)                     
*                                                                               
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
     T01-IDLANDX2  = IN3-IDLANDX2                                               
     PUT TFIL02 FROM TFIL01                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
SORT TFIL02 TO TFIL03 USING T02-IDARTNR                                         
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TFIL03 KEY T03-IDARTNR  +                                            
           TMRHIST KEY MR-IDARTNR)                                              
*                                                                               
  IF MATCHED                                                                    
     STDPR  = MR-KVANTMOT * T03-PRARTSTD                                        
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
                                                                                
*******                                                                         
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*******                                                                         
REPORT     RAPPORT01            +                                               
           PRINTER W55182D4     +                                               
           LINESIZE  51         +                                               
           PAGESIZE 32767       +                                               
           SPACE 0              +                                               
           SKIP  0              +                                               
           TITLESKIP 0          +                                               
           NOHEADING            +                                               
           NOSPREAD             +                                               
           NOADJUST             +                                               
           NODATE               +                                               
           SUMMARY                                                              
           SEQUENCE T03-IDLANDX2 MR-IDLEVNR-INL                                 
           CONTROL  FINAL NOPRINT NOPRINT T03-IDLANDX2   +                      
                    NOPRINT MR-IDLEVNR-INL NOPRINT W-FILL-01                    
                                                                                
 LINE      T03-IDLANDX2          W-FILL-01 +                                    
           MR-IDLEVNR-INL        W-FILL-01 +                                    
           STDPR                 W-FILL-01 +                                    
           TALLY                 W-FILL-01                                      
*                                                                               
BEFORE-BREAK. PROC                                                              
 IF FIRST-LINE = 'J'                                                            
   DISPLAY '§DAPW55182-001'                                                     
   DISPLAY '§DAPW55182'                                                         
   DISPLAY 'COUNTRY;SUPPLIER NO;TOTAL VALUE;NO OF UNITS;'                       
   FIRST-LINE  = 'N'                                                            
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
